<title>HONG KONG: Jingwei Textile 1996 net rises 12.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Jingwei Textile 1996 net rises 12.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million yuan unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (yuan)		   0.20	 vs 0.31 (see note)</p>
<p>    Dividend (yuan)	    0.04	 vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  31.89 gain vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    77.58	vs 68.76</p>
<p>    Turnover		     654.45     vs 717.19</p>
<p>    Company name		 Jingwei Textile Machinery Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  May 10 to June 9</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 27</p>
<p>NOTE - Jingwei Textile is a Chinese textile machinery maker.</p>
<p>The exceptional item represents interest income from banks and a fellow subsidiary, which was mainly derived from proceeds of the H-share issue and A-share issue not yet used but placed as deposits with banks and the fellow subsidiary during the year.</p>
<p>Share earnings are based on the weighted average of 387.71 million shares vs 220 million shares.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
